DATA ACKNOWLEDGMENTS
====================

This work makes use of data from:

1. Fermi Large Area Telescope (Fermi-LAT)
   - 3FHL Catalog
   - Credit: Fermi-LAT Collaboration
   - https://fermi.gsfc.nasa.gov/

2. IceCube Neutrino Observatory
   - Neutrino stacking analysis results
   - Credit: IceCube Collaboration
   - https://icecube.wisc.edu/

3. Pierre Auger Observatory
   - Ultra-high-energy cosmic ray spectrum
   - Credit: Pierre Auger Collaboration
   - https://www.auger.org/

4. CT18 Parton Distribution Functions
   - NNLO PDF sets
   - Credit: CTEQ-TEA Collaboration
   - https://hep.pa.msu.edu/cteq/

Please cite these data sources appropriately in any publications.
